<!-- Default Auto Filters library shipped with Lemoine Tools.

     Copied into a project the FIRST time the Filters window is opened there, then that
     project owns its copy outright - edits never travel back here or sideways into
     another project. Delete this file to have new projects start blank instead.

     A user-supplied %AppData%\LemoineTools\Seed\AutoFiltersSeed.xml overrides this one.

     Trade and rule Ids are deliberately STABLE across installs: filter ownership is
     stamped into the model with these ids, so two people working the same model from
     the same standard recognise each other's filters instead of treating them as
     orphans. Do not randomise them. -->
